    "description": "- Create a mobile shopping solution containing 1 mobile application, 1 web application and 3 backend services in the span of 1 year. Each component contained their own set of automated testing, CI/CD pipeline and performance test suite.\n- Created development, pre-production and production environments from the ground up alongside upper management to set new guidelines for managing and deploying new GCP projects.\n- Designed and developed several CI/CD pipelines with Github Actions and guided other teams in the corporation in switching from Jenkins to Github Actions. These CI/CD pipelines were created for a suite of different applications to verify and deploy changes to the cloud or to an artifactory.\n- Onboarded and mentored multiple new hires. Showed current processes, answered questions and assisted on Jira tickets when needed for smoother transitioning\n- Conduct interviews for undergraduate hiring for 3 years. Worked with other hiring managers and HR to finalize hiring and placement of candidates based off of previous projects and current skill sets.\n- Advocate left shift testing and developed multiple integration, performance, and unit test suites through applications such as Postman and JMeter\n- Temporarily take ownership of the product and execute tasks normally given to a Product Owner such as: communicate with the director to build a roadmap for the upcoming quarter, own and lead agile meetings such as standup, sprint showcase, retrospective and PI planning.\n- Create an automated Looker dashboard system to display quarterly progress for upper management",
